    "date": "2026-06-10",
    "markdown": "### Added\n\n- **Claude Fable 5 is available in the Claude model picker** ([#1443](https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/pull/1443) by [@0-Captain](https://github.com/0-Captain))"
